# arm32 vectors of the alu32 group (Thumb-2 code): the state after each case of
# cases/alu32.cases under qemu-arm-static (-cpu max) over 3 states a case, written by
# write_arm32_vectors in crates/ra-asm-lift/tests/vectors/arm32.rs and replayed by its arm32 test.
# case <kind> <bytes> <assembly> <- <template>; in: the registers the case sets (the rest are
# zero), the flags as NZCV bits, the window of data bytes; out: where the case stopped and
# what it changed.
case Alu 01f10000 add.w r0, r1, #0 <- add.w {Rd}, {Rn}, #{modimm}
in nzcv=0111 r0=0x7 r1=0xa
out pc=0x30002004 sig=trap r0=0xa
case Alu 01f10000 add.w r0, r1, #0 <- add.w {Rd}, {Rn}, #{modimm}
in nzcv=0000 r0=0x3ffff r1=0x80000002
out pc=0x30002004 sig=trap r0=0x80000002
